\section*{B.6 Summary}
The stress-test data confirm:
\begin{itemize}
\item hydraulic wave attenuation remained below $0.001\%$ across all runs,
\item telemetry buffer overflow never occurred at $1.2$ MHz sampling,
\item cryptographic throughput synchronized with hydraulic gradients,
\item zeroization triggered precisely at turbulence onset ($\mathrm{Re} > \mathrm{Re}_{\mathrm{crit}}$).
\end{itemize}

These results validate the DF-HITSE architecture under maximum-load conditions.